IOrderRepository as a dependency and implements OnActionExecutionAsync. This
implementation class is contained in an attribute class that implements
TypeFilterAttribute.
After declaring the attribute class, we can proceed by implementing the logic.
OrderExistsAttribute has three purposes:
To check whether the incoming request contains an id
To check whether the requested id is a Guid
To query IOrderRepository to check whether the entity exists
Let's proceed by describing a possible implementation of the previous logic:
